00:18:29.222 --> 00:18:32.743
<v Daniel>And that calculation uses a mathematical function called softmax.</v>

189
00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:44.015
<v Maya>So if a model has a vocabulary of 100,000 different tokens, it has to run 100,000 probability calculations for every single chunk of text it spits out.</v>

190
00:18:44.267 --> 00:18:59.003
